":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 35 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, more than any other pair. In 2026 so far, that same middle shows February to March at 66% of normal and March to April at 67%. Every grid in the county had its driest year in 1963, with grids 21788, 21789 and 21790 at 67% of normal that year.</p>"}
